  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Profession and work",
   "texto": [
    "To say a profession you can use **Saya guru** («I'm a teacher.») or **Saya seorang guru** («I'm a teaching person.»). The name of the profession does not change according to gender.",
    "**Kerja** is «work»; **bekerja**, «work»; **pekerjaan**, «profesión/ocupación». The **ber-** prefix forms a verb here. People do not change the form of the verb: **saya bekerja**, **dia bekerja**."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Location and destination",
   "texto": [
    "**Di kantor** places someone «in the office». **Pergi ke kantor** indicates that «to the office» is going. In this use, **ke** points to the destination and **di** to the place where it is."
   ]
  },
